{"id":"n63547-1-7","stage":1,"title":"세수 · 洗脸","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63547-1-7-1","ko":"승규야, 고양이 세수 좀 하지 말고 깨끗이 씻어라.","zh":"承奎，别那么马虎地洗脸，要洗干净。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"고양이","meaning":"猫（고양이 세수：草草洗脸）","explanation":"고양이：猫；고양이 세수 是洗脸马虎、只略沾水的惯用搭配。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}},{"text":"세수","meaning":"洗脸","explanation":"세수：洗脸","readings":[{"term":"세수","audio":"/audio/c24f9137a367703c47b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63547","senseId":"1","lemma":"세수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세수","audio":"/audio/c24f9137a367703c47b2.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"하지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"깨끗이","meaning":"完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","explanation":"깨끗이：完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","readings":[{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61076","senseId":"5","lemma":"깨끗이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}},{"text":"씻어라.","meaning":"洗，刷","explanation":"씻다：洗，刷；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"씻다","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17191","senseId":"1","lemma":"씻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씻어라","audio":"/audio/3bf9a7feded195d0e711.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"c24f9137a367703c","term":"세수","zh":"洗脸","audio":"/audio/c24f9137a367703c47b2.mp3","entryId":"63547","definition":"用水清洗手或脸。","pronunciation":["세ː수"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"356f24a2b3817821","term":"깨끗이","zh":"完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3","entryId":"61076","definition":"毫无留痕地。","pronunciation":["깨끄시"]},{"id":"1fc19ed194af1338","term":"씻다","zh":"洗，刷","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3","entryId":"17191","definition":"除去污垢或脏的东西而使之干净。","pronunciation":["씯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9757325bf9323c3b470b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63547-1-7-2","ko":"알겠어요, 엄마.","zh":"知道了，妈妈。","note":"点不懂的